By replacing brittle boolean logic with **Symmetric Ternary Logic (-1, 0, +1)**, mapping decision spaces into **Hyperbolic Lobachevsky/Poincaré Geometry**, and enforcing strict multi-mask safety via **Double Rashomon** and **LearningGuard**, the system achieves absolute structural determinism, zero-drift bounded self-adaptation, and microsecond-level reaction speeds.

